{"3484690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drones of War: FPV Drone Simulator", "steam_appid": 3484690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're an amateur or a professional FPV pilot, improve your skills or start fresh with <strong>Drones of War</strong>! With its realistic simulation based on real flight dynamics, customize your own FPV drone and feel like you're flying in a real battlefield—without risking your drone! Explore diverse maps and strengthen your knowledge and experience by battling against AI-controlled enemies. Hone your piloting skills in high-stakes scenarios, strategize your attacks, and master the art of precision strikes in this intense FPV kamikaze simulator. Test your limits, dominate the battlefield, and take your FPV gameplay to the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't have a drone controller yet: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>                                                                    MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beach</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484690/extras/2e4900fa27f18157fd9df2f8ae90a2ba.poster.avif?t=1775115388\" width=690 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484690/extras/2e4900fa27f18157fd9df2f8ae90a2ba.webm?t=1775115388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484690/extras/2e4900fa27f18157fd9df2f8ae90a2ba.mp4?t=1775115388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rural</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3